max(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Longo &#8211; 20 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 650m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto &#8211; 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 350m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Trilho Medieval<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 200m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trilho Medieval 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 4 de Outubro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas na freguesia de Cambra, no concelho de Vouzela, distrito de Viseu.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento oferece tr\u00eas percursos: Trail Longo de 20 km, Trail Curto de 10 km e uma Caminhada pedestre aberta a todas as idades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O Trilho Medieval faz parte de algum circuito?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, \u00e9 a terceira etapa do circuito Vouzela Epic Trails 2026, promovido pelo Munic\u00edpio de Vouzela.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios previstos de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas est\u00e3o programadas a partir das 09:00 para o Trail Longo de 20 km, \u00e0s 09:30 para o Trail Curto de 10 km e \u00e0s 09:35 para a Caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento e efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento em PDF est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na plataforma Stop and Go atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial indicada nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilho Medieval 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cambra, Vouzela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cambra, Vouzela\", \"addressRegion\": \"Cambra, Vouzela\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trilho Medieval 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 4 de Outubro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas na freguesia de Cambra, no concelho de Vouzela, distrito de Viseu.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento oferece tr\u00eas percursos: Trail Longo de 20 km, Trail Curto de 10 km e uma Caminhada pedestre aberta a todas as idades.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O Trilho Medieval faz parte de algum circuito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, \u00e9 a terceira etapa do circuito Vouzela Epic Trails 2026, promovido pelo Munic\u00edpio de Vouzela.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios previstos de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As partidas est\u00e3o programadas a partir das 09:00 para o Trail Longo de 20 km, \u00e0s 09:30 para o Trail Curto de 10 km e \u00e0s 09:35 para a Caminhada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento e efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento em PDF est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis na platafo